Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.37,0:01:49.21,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(3300,480)\pos(930,750)\fnDream Han Serif SC W27\c&H743000&\3c&HFAFBFA&\bord6\blur2\fs90\fsp5}小书痴的下克{\fsp0}上\N{\fs30\bord4\fnFZLanTingYuan-DB-GBK\fsp5\blur1}为了成为图书管理员不择手{\fsp0}段\N{\fnDream Han Serif SC W18\fscx90\fsp15\fs70\c&HD79712&\bord5\blur2}领主的养{\fsp0}女
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.87,0:01:45.84,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}在只差一步时跌倒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.84,0:01:49.51,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,以为到极限而消沉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.51,0:01:51.51,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,但我依然坚持前行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.51,0:01:55.30,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,不甘心就这样结束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.30,0:01:58.26,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,只要闭上双眼想象
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.30,0:01:58.26,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0\t(106,565,\blur2)\t(565,815,\blur0)}只要闭上{\alpha&HFF&}双眼想象
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.26,0:02:02.35,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,总能看见你在身旁
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.26,0:02:02.35,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0\t(66,400,\blur2)\t(400,858,\blur0)}总能看见{\alpha&HFF&}你在身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.35,0:02:07.32,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,面带我最爱的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:09.61,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,安静一点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.61,0:02:13.49,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,故事还在进行之中
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.61,0:02:13.49,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0\t(2980,3355,\blur3)\t(3355,3772,\blur0)}故事还在进行之中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.49,0:02:15.91,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,安静一点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.91,0:02:19.87,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,让我们翻开下一页
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.87,0:02:23.12,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,不用担心我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:26.79,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,只因心中时刻有你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.79,0:02:29.92,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,总能听见你的助威
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.92,0:02:31.67,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,让我变得更加坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.67,0:02:35.09,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,就算觉得坚持不住
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.09,0:02:38.85,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,忍不住要流下眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.85,0:02:41.93,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,总能听见你的助威
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.93,0:02:44.89,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,我一直都感觉良好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.89,0:02:47.86,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,绝对不会轻言放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.86,0:02:54.03,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\t(5700,6180,\alpha&HC8&)}爱的力量多么神奇
Comment: 0,0:21:46.04,0:21:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ending
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.33,0:21:54.42,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(980,0)}就算身处遥远又未知的星球
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.42,0:21:58.55,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,仰望着头顶的那片陌生的天空
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.55,0:22:02.51,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,就算深爱过的人和许下的诺言
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.51,0:22:05.76,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,还有其他的一切都不在手边
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.76,0:22:10.77,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\t(750,1810,\alpha&H00&)\3c&HB5C2BF&\bord6\blur4}我依然记忆犹新
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.76,0:22:10.77,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,我依然记忆犹新
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.77,0:22:13.90,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HB5C2BF&\bord6\blur4}时间之海默默记录着你的一切
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.77,0:22:13.90,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,时间之海默默记录着你的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.90,0:22:21.07,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\t(690,1840,\alpha&HFF&)\3c&HB5C2BF&\bord6\blur4}你轻轻推开了沉没在海中的
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.90,0:22:21.07,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,你轻轻推开了沉没在海中的
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.07,0:22:23.20,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,那扇门
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.20,0:22:24.91,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1100,0)\3c&HBED6CA&\bord6\blur4}Wanna me Wanna me Wanna me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.20,0:22:24.91,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,Wanna me Wanna me Wanna me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.91,0:22:29.00,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HBED6CA&\bord6\blur4}在别人对我有所认知之前
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.91,0:22:29.00,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,在别人对我有所认知之前
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.00,0:22:31.29,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HBED6CA&\bord6\blur4}我实际上
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.00,0:22:31.29,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,我实际上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.29,0:22:33.12,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1840)\3c&HBED6CA&\bord6\blur4}Gonna me Gonna me Gonna me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.29,0:22:33.12,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,Gonna me Gonna me Gonna me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.12,0:22:36.09,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,对自己有清楚的认知
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.09,0:22:39.46,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,独自一人也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.46,0:22:41.26,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1810,0)\3c&HACA69C&\bord6\blur4}随着季节更替
